  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "Adjectives in **-o** have four forms: alt**o**, alt**a**, alt**i**, alt**e**. Adjectives in **-e** have only two: giovan**e** (singular) and giovan**i** (plural).",
      "Notice the plurals: masculine -o makes the plural in **-i** and feminine -a, in **-e**. There's no -s plural.",
      "To describe: **È alto** (he's tall), **Ha i capelli lunghi** (he/she has long hair)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
